	(text "Input protection and motor supply (VM)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0efa1c79-6f1a-5c6d-b6ff-c361839d5a91")
	)
	(text "AP2112K: 600 mA, 1 uF in and out (Diodes AP2112 datasheet).\nInput +5V minus one Schottky: >= 4.5 V,\nabove 3.3 V + 400 mV dropout (ASSUMPTION: at 600 mA).\nLoad: STM32WB55 + LEDs, under 100 mA (ASSUMPTION).\nC212: the 4.7 uF bulk of DS11929 Fig. 16 (VDD)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5328b0e3-ee58-5b1c-a2d8-b5fdc7221e81")
	)
	(text "5 V buck (LMR36510, SNVSBD7B 8.2 Design 1)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.09 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bd14bb5f-1336-5779-814e-ffe9cbe26b15")
	)
	(text "Table 8-1, 400 kHz, VOUT 5 V: L 22 uH,\nCOUT 2 x 22 uF, RFBT 100k, RFBB 24.9k,\nCIN 2.2 uF + 220 nF (4.7 uF used, 50 V).\nVOUT = 1.0 V * (1 + 100k/24.9k) = 5.02 V.\nEN tied to VIN (Pin Functions, EN).\nPG open drain to +3V3 (MCU input).\nD203/D204: OR with USB VBUS; ~0.4 V drop.\nASSUMPTION: L201 Isat >= 1 A (SWPA4030)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 332.74 113.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e1621ad7-6289-5a21-bc70-5857d666013f")
	)
	(text "3.3 V LDO (AP2112K-3.3)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ea37d68d-eaaa-5410-84ea-b1cdd2467508")
	)
	(text "Input 24 V nominal, 30 V max (HW-PWR-001). Every part on VM is rated >= 52 V: DRV8711 VM 8-52 V (SLVSC40H 6.3),\nLMR36510 4.2-65 V (SNVSBD7B 1), CSD18543Q3A 60 V (SLPS633 1).\nF201 3 A fast (Littelfuse 451): the motor supply's design current, sets VM's class PWR_3A.\nQ201: reverse polarity in the return leg; body diode conducts first, R201/D202 then enhance it; D202 clamps\nVGS to 15 V (CSD18543Q3A VGS max +-20 V). Reversed input: body diode blocks, VGS < 0.\nD201 SMAJ33A: VRWM 33 V above the 30 V max input, VC 53.3 V below the 60 V FET rating (ASSUMPTION: VC at 7.5 A).\nC201 100 uF + C202 4.7 uF: DRV8711 bulk, SLVSC40H 9.1 and Pin Functions (VM: 0.01 uF + 100 uF).\nVM_SENSE = VM * 10k / 110k: 30 V -> 2.73 V, under VDDA 3.3 V (derived). C203 with R202||R203 = 9.1 kohm: fc 175 Hz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ece8e2a3-88ec-50fe-8f49-d93537c0d726")
	)
